  "description": "config.v1 §2.18: a desired document against a schema -> accepted, or refused whole before anything applies, with the first problem found. schemas is as in validation.json, writable being the startup allowlist. document is a DesiredConfig: {revision, values: {group: {parameter: value}}}. The owner takes the groups in the bytewise (UTF-8) order of their names; for each group: not declared (not_found), contract (contract), reach (reach), outside the allowlist (unavailable); then each parameter in the bytewise order of its name: not declared (not_found), sensitive (sensitive), of the wrong kind or out of bounds (invalid_request), as validation.json reads values. expect is {accepted: true}, or {refused: {code, group, parameter (absent for a group's own check)}}, which the owner reports in its view's and status's desired.refusal.",
